---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '中国免签证国家名单（2026）——中国入门指南';
const description = '有资格免签证进入中国的国家官方名单——单边（50个国家）和共同协议（29个国家）。';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/prepare/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Prepare
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">📋 入境和签证</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        China Visa-Free Countries List (2026)
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">检查你的国家是否有资格免签证进入中国。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>忘记谷歌和脸书吧——这是你真正需要的。</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">⏱️ 阅读4分钟</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>免签证进入中国有两种方式：</strong> China offers unilateral visa-free entry to citizens of <strong>50个国家</strong> (up to 30 days), and has mutual visa-free agreements with <strong>29个国家</strong>. If your country isn't on either list, check the 240-hour transit policy or apply for an L visa.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Below are the complete lists based on the latest official data from the Chinese government (2025). Source: <a href="http://big5.www.gov.cn/gate/big5/www.gov.cn/yaowen/liebiao/202508/content_7035244.htm" class="text-brand-600 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中国政府网</a>.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <!-- Section 1: Unilateral -->
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🟢</span> Unilateral Visa-Free (50 Countries)
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Citizens of these countries can enter China <strong>没有签证</strong> for up to <strong>30天</strong>. No advance application needed.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 font-medium">适用范围：旅游、商务、探亲、过境、文化交流。最多30天。</p>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">欧洲（35）</h3>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <span>France</span><span>Germany</span><span>Italy</span>
          <span>Netherlands</span><span>Spain</span><span>Switzerland</span>
          <span>Ireland</span><span>Hungary</span><span>Austria</span>
          <span>Belgium</span><span>Luxembourg</span><span>Poland</span>
          <span>Portugal</span><span>Greece</span><span>Cyprus</span>
          <span>Slovenia</span><span>Slovakia</span><span>Norway</span>
          <span>Finland</span><span>Denmark</span><span>Iceland</span>
          <span>Andorra</span><span>Monaco</span><span>Liechtenstein</span>
          <span>Bulgaria</span><span>Romania</span><span>Croatia</span>
          <span>Montenegro</span><span>北马其顿</span><span>Malta</span>
          <span>Estonia</span><span>Latvia</span><span>Russia</span>
          <span>Sweden</span><span>英国</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">亚洲（7）</h3>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <span>Brunei</span><span>韩国</span><span>Japan</span>
          <span>沙特阿拉伯</span><span>Oman</span><span>Kuwait</span>
          <span>Bahrain</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">美洲（6）</h3>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <span>Brazil</span><span>Argentina</span><span>Chile</span>
          <span>Peru</span><span>Uruguay</span><span>Canada</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">大洋洲（2）</h3>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <span>Australia</span><span>新西兰</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Not sure which one applies to you? -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose mt-8 mb-12">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🤔 不确定哪项政策适用于贵国？</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <a href="/zh/visa/transit-240/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">✈️ 240小时免签证过境</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">在指定地区长达10天，覆盖包括美国在内的55个国家。</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/mutual-agreement/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">🤝 相互免签证协议</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">29个国家有双边免签证协议，停留期限各不相同。</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/apply-l-visa/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">📝 申请L旅游签证</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">如果你的国家不在任何免签证名单上，请申请标准旅游签证。</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/cities/hainan-visa-free/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">🏝️ 海南30天免签证</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">59个国家符合条件，包括美国、墨西哥、菲律宾和其他不在大陆名单上的国家。</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📚 来源</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://en.nia.gov.cn/n147418/n147463/c183390/content.html" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">国家移民局——单方面免签证国家名单</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.gov.cn/yaowen/liebiao/202508/content_7035244.htm" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gov.cn——哪些国家可以免签证访问中国？一个全面的列表！</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://cs.mfa.gov.cn/wgrlh/lhqz/lhqzjjs/202510/t20251023_11739051.shtml" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">外交部-互免签证协定</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关指南</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/visa/visa-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">中国签证类型完整指南</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">解释所有签证选项</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/transit-240/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">240小时免签证过境说明</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">10天无签证过境</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>